{"seq":3,"slug":"build-systems","title":"C++ 构建系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-systems/build-systems","wordCount":942,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"c-构建系统\">C++ 构建系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>C++ 构建系统负责管理编译单元的编译、链接和依赖关系。由于 C++ 没有内置的模块系统（直到 C++20 Modules），源文件之间通过头文件（#include）产生复杂的依赖关系，构建系统必须正确处理这些依赖以避免遗漏重编译或不必要的全量重编。从 Make 到 CMake 再到现代构建系统（Bazel、Meson），C++ 构建工具链在可维护性、构建速度和跨平台支持之间不断演进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[C++ 构建流程] --&gt; B[预处理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[编译]&#10;    C --&gt; D[汇编]&#10;    D --&gt; E[链接]&#10;    A --&gt; F[构建系统]&#10;    F --&gt; G[CMake]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Bazel]&#10;    F --&gt; I[Meson]&#10;    F --&gt; J[Make]&#10;    E --&gt; K[可执行文件/库]&#10;    subgraph 依赖管理&#10;        L[vcpkg]&#10;        M[Conan]&#10;        N[CPM.cmake]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[C++ 构建流程] --&gt; B[预处理]\n    B --&gt; C[编译]\n    C --&gt; D[汇编]\n    D --&gt; E[链接]\n    A --&gt; F[构建系统]\n    F --&gt; G[CMake]\n    F --&gt; H[Bazel]\n    F --&gt; I[Meson]\n    F --&gt; J[Make]\n    E --&gt; K[可执行文件/库]\n    subgraph 依赖管理\n        L[vcpkg]\n        M[Conan]\n        N[CPM.cmake]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建系统</th>\n<th>配置语言</th>\n<th>跨平台</th>\n<th>增量构建</th>\n<th>远程缓存</th>\n<th>生态成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CMake</td>\n<td>CMake 语言</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>需插件</td>\n<td>最广泛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bazel</td>\n<td>Starlark</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>Google 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meson</td>\n<td>Python-like</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>需配置</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Make</td>\n<td>Makefile</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>基本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>传统项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ninja</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>无（纯执行器）</td>\n<td>后端引擎</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cmake-核心实践\">CMake 核心实践</h2><p>CMake 是当前 C++ 项目最广泛使用的构建系统生成器。它不直接执行构建，而是生成底层构建系统（Ninja、Make、Visual Studio 等）的项目文件。现代 CMake（3.x）强调基于目标（target-based）的配置，取代了传统的基于变量的全局配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cmake\" data-code=\"cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.20)&#10;project(MyProject VERSION 1.0.0 LANGUAGES CXX)&#10;&#10;set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20)&#10;set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)&#10;set(CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS ON)&#10;&#10;add_library(core STATIC&#10;    src/core/engine.cpp&#10;    src/core/parser.cpp&#10;    src/core/serializer.cpp&#10;)&#10;&#10;target_include_directories(core&#10;    PUBLIC&#10;        $&lt;BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/include&gt;&#10;        $&lt;INSTALL_INTERFACE:include&gt;&#10;    PRIVATE&#10;        ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/src&#10;)&#10;&#10;target_compile_options(core&#10;    PRIVATE&#10;        $&lt;$&lt;CXX_COMPILER_ID:GNU&gt;:-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic&gt;&#10;        $&lt;$&lt;CXX_COMPILER_ID:Clang&gt;:-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic&gt;&#10;        $&lt;$&lt;CXX_COMPILER_ID:MSVC&gt;:/W4&gt;&#10;)&#10;&#10;add_executable(app src/main.cpp)&#10;target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE core)&#10;&#10;enable_testing()&#10;add_subdirectory(tests)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>project(MyProject VERSION 1.0.0 LANGUAGES CXX)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set(CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS ON)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add_library(core STATIC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    src/core/engine.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    src/core/parser.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    src/core/serializer.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target_include_directories(core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PUBLIC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $&#x3C;BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/include></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $&#x3C;INSTALL_INTERFACE:include></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PRIVATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/src</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target_compile_options(core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PRIVATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $&#x3C;$&#x3C;CXX_COMPILER_ID:GNU>:-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $&#x3C;$&#x3C;CXX_COMPILER_ID:Clang>:-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $&#x3C;$&#x3C;CXX_COMPILER_ID:MSVC>:/W4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add_executable(app src/main.cpp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE core)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enable_testing()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add_subdirectory(tests)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct CMakeBestPractice {&#10;    static constexpr auto kUseTargetProperties = true;&#10;    static constexpr auto kAvoidGlobalVariables = true;&#10;    static constexpr auto kUseGeneratorExpressions = true;&#10;    static constexpr auto kExportCompileCommands = true;&#10;    static constexpr auto kSetStandardOnTarget = true;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CMakeBestPractice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kUseTargetProperties </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kAvoidGlobalVariables </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kUseGeneratorExpressions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kExportCompileCommands </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kSetStandardOnTarget </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CMake 实践</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n<th>避免做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设置编译标准</td>\n<td>target_compile_features</td>\n<td>CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加头文件路径</td>\n<td>target_include_directories</td>\n<td>include_directories 全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接依赖</td>\n<td>target_link_libraries</td>\n<td>link_libraries 全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译选项</td>\n<td>target_compile_options</td>\n<td>add_compile_options 全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找依赖</td>\n<td>find_package + 目标</td>\n<td>手动设 INCLUDE/LIB 变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖管理\">依赖管理</h2><p>C++ 长期缺乏统一的包管理器，但 vcpkg 和 Conan 两大工具的成熟极大改善了依赖管理体验。vcpkg 由 Microsoft 维护，与 CMake 集成紧密；Conan 由 JFrog 维护，更灵活的版本管理和二进制兼容性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cmake\" data-code=\"# vcpkg 集成方式&#10;# cmake -B build -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=$VCPKG_ROOT/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake&#10;find_package(fmt CONFIG REQUIRED)&#10;find_package(spdlog CONFIG REQUIRED)&#10;find_package(nlohmann_json CONFIG REQUIRED)&#10;&#10;target_link_libraries(app&#10;    PRIVATE&#10;        fmt::fmt&#10;        spdlog::spdlog&#10;        nlohmann_json::nlohmann_json&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># vcpkg 集成方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cmake -B build -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=$VCPKG_ROOT/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>find_package(fmt CONFIG REQUIRED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>find_package(spdlog CONFIG REQUIRED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>find_package(nlohmann_json CONFIG REQUIRED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target_link_libraries(app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PRIVATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fmt::fmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        spdlog::spdlog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nlohmann_json::nlohmann_json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DependencyManager {&#10;  readonly name: string;&#10;  readonly manifesto: string;&#10;  readonly binaryCache: boolean;&#10;  readonly crossPlatform: boolean;&#10;  readonly cmakeIntegration: &#39;toolchain&#39; | &#39;find_package&#39; | &#39;both&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const dependencyManagers: ReadonlyArray&lt;DependencyManager&gt; = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;vcpkg&#39;,&#10;    manifesto: &#39;vcpkg.json&#39;,&#10;    binaryCache: true,&#10;    crossPlatform: true,&#10;    cmakeIntegration: &#39;toolchain&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;Conan&#39;,&#10;    manifesto: &#39;conanfile.py&#39;,&#10;    binaryCache: true,&#10;    crossPlatform: true,&#10;    cmakeIntegration: &#39;both&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;CPM.cmake&#39;,&#10;    manifesto: &#39;CMakeLists.txt&#39;,&#10;    binaryCache: false,&#10;    crossPlatform: true,&#10;    cmakeIntegration: &#39;find_package&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> manifesto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> binaryCache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> crossPlatform</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\