s=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    crossPlatform: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cmakeIntegration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'toolchain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Conan'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    manifesto: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'conanfile.py'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    binaryCache: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    crossPlatform: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cmakeIntegration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'both'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CPM.cmake'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    manifesto: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMakeLists.txt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    binaryCache: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    crossPlatform: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cmakeIntegration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'find_package'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n<th>包数量</th>\n<th>二进制缓存</th>\n<th>版本约束</th>\n<th>自定义构建</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vcpkg</td>\n<td>2000+</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>基线版本</td>\n<td>端口文件</td>\n<td>企业级项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conan</td>\n<td>1500+</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>灵活范围</td>\n<td>配方脚本</td>\n<td>复杂依赖图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPM.cmake</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>Git 标签</td>\n<td>CMake 原生</td>\n<td>小型项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FetchContent</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Git 标签</td>\n<td>CMake 原生</td>\n<td>少量依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构建优化与-ci-cd\">构建优化与 CI/CD</h2><p>大型 C++ 项目的构建时间可能长达数十分钟甚至数小时。构建优化是提升开发效率的关键投资，常见策略包括：预编译头文件（PCH）、编译缓存（ccache/sccache）、分布式编译（distcc/icecc）和增量构建优化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cmake\" data-code=\"# 预编译头文件 (CMake 3.16+)&#10;target_precompile_headers(core&#10;    PRIVATE&#10;        &lt;vector&gt;&#10;        &lt;string&gt;&#10;        &lt;memory&gt;&#10;        &lt;unordered_map&gt;&#10;        &lt;algorithm&gt;&#10;        &lt;functional&gt;&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 编译缓存&#10;find_program(CCACHE_PROGRAM ccache)&#10;if(CCACHE_PROGRAM)&#10;    set(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_LAUNCHER ${CCACHE_PROGRAM})&#10;endif()&#10;&#10;# Unity Build (CMake 3.16+)&#10;set_target_properties(core PROPERTIES UNITY_BUILD ON)&#10;set_target_properties(core PROPERTIES UNITY_BUILD_BATCH_SIZE 8)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 预编译头文件 (CMake 3.16+)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target_precompile_headers(core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PRIVATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;vector></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;string></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;memory></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;unordered_map></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;algorithm></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;functional></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 编译缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>find_program(CCACHE_PROGRAM ccache)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if(CCACHE_PROGRAM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_LAUNCHER ${CCACHE_PROGRAM})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>endif()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Unity Build (CMake 3.16+)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_target_properties(core PROPERTIES UNITY_BUILD ON)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_target_properties(core PROPERTIES UNITY_BUILD_BATCH_SIZE 8)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BuildOptimization {&#10;  readonly technique: string;&#10;  readonly speedup: string;&#10;  readonly tradeoff: string;&#10;  readonly setupComplexity: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const buildOptimizations: ReadonlyArray&lt;BuildOptimization&gt; = [&#10;  { technique: &#39;预编译头文件 (PCH)&#39;, speedup: &#39;20-50%&#39;, tradeoff: &#39;头文件变更需重编&#39;, setupComplexity: &#39;low&#39; },&#10;  { technique: &#39;ccache&#39;, speedup: &#39;70-90% 缓存命中&#39;, tradeoff: &#39;首次无效&#39;, setupComplexity: &#39;low&#39; },&#10;  { technique: &#39;Unity Build&#39;, speedup: &#39;30-70%&#39;, tradeoff: &#39;可能引入名称冲突&#39;, setupComplexity: &#39;low&#39; },&#10;  { technique: &#39;分布式编译&#39;, speedup: &#39;线性扩展&#39;, tradeoff: &#39;网络带宽、配置复杂&#39;, setupComplexity: &#39;high&#39; },&#10;  { technique: &#39;Modules (C++20)&#39;, speedup: &#39;50-80%&#39;, tradeoff: &#39;编译器支持不完整&#39;, setupComplexity: &#39;medium&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BuildOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> technique</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> speedup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> tradeoff</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> setupComplexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buildOptimizations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BuildOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { technique: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'预编译头文件 (PCH)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speedup: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20-50%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tradeoff: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'头文件变更需重编'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, setupComplexity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { technique: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ccache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speedup: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'70-90% 缓存命中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tradeoff: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'首次无效'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, setupComplexity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { technique: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Unity Build'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speedup: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30-70%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tradeoff: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可能引入名称冲突'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, setupComplexity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { technique: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分布式编译'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speedup: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'线性扩展'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tradeoff: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'网络带宽、配置复杂'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, setupComplexity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { technique: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Modules (C++20)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speedup: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50-80%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tradeoff: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'编译器支持不完整'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, setupComplexity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CI/CD 集成方面，CMake 的 CTest 提供了内置的测试框架集成，配合 CMake Presets（CMakePresets.json）可以统一开发和 CI 环境的配置。GitHub Actions、GitLab CI 和 Jenkins 都有成熟的 CMake 构建模板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CMake 是 C++ 项目最广泛的构建系统生成器，现代 CMake 强调基于目标的配置</li>\n<li>vcpkg 和 Conan 是两大主流包管理器，解决了 C++ 长期缺乏统一依赖管理的痛点</li>\n<li>构建优化通过 PCH、ccache、Unity Build 和分布式编译显著缩短编译时间</li>\n<li>Ninja 作为后端引擎比 Make 快 2-10 倍，是 CMake 的推荐构建后端</li>\n<li>C++20 Modules 将从根本上解决头文件引起的编译时间和依赖管理问题</li>\n<li>CI/CD 集成使用 CMake Presets 统一本地和 CI 环境的构建配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../cpp-modern/cpp17-cpp20\">C++17/C++20 新特性</a>——本篇多次提到 Modules 对构建的影响，回看 Modules 在语言层面的设计目标。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../memory-management/memory-pitfalls\">内存陷阱与调试</a>——构建中集成 Sanitizer（-fsanitize=address）是常态化质量门，这里讲其检测能力。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../c-language-programming/modern-c-and-engineering/build-toolchain-and-debugging\">C 语言·构建工具链与调试</a>——C 与 C++ 共享编译/链接模型与工具链，对照理解预处理-编译-链接全流程。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../go-language/packages-and-modules/dependency-management\">Go·依赖管理</a>——Go modules 内建于语言，对比 C++ 用 vcpkg/Conan 外挂式补齐包管理的不同路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"C++ 构建系统","id":"c-构建系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CMake 核心实践","id":"cmake-核心实践"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖管理","id":"依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"构建优化与 CI/CD","id":"构建优化与-ci-cd"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"IO 与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-systems/io-networking"},"next":{"title":"函数模板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/templates-generics/function-templates"}}